    {
      "label": {
        "en": "Quest 03 — Declare Yourself!",
        "jp": "Quest 03 — Declare Yourself!"
      },
      "rows": [
        {
          "h": 2,
          "cells": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "w": 6,
              "label": {
                "en": "Congress roleplay",
                "jp": "議会のロールプレイ"
              },
              "heading": "Declare Yourself!",
              "body": [
                "Students navigate the historical debate of the Declaration of Independence as members of the Second Continental Congress. They embody historical figures, arguing their stances with evidence and teamwork, aiming to sway opinions."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "w": 6,
              "label": {
                "en": "Design rationale — the drawer UI",
                "jp": "設計の理由 — 引き出しの UI"
              },
              "body": [
                "The interface design takes inspiration from the historical drawers commonly found in congress buildings. Each of the four main UI navigation elements functions like a drawer, allowing users to “pull out” each section by clicking on its corresponding tab. This interactive drawer mechanism provides access to distinct activities within the learning experience, making navigation intuitive and immersing users in a tactile, period-appropriate design that reflects the setting of the content."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "h": 4,
          "cells": [
            {
              "kind": "embed",
